        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOGEOCOM, Georgetown Lever Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Traditional Georgetown Single Cylinder Entryset comes packaged with all the parts you'll need to install it on a front door; it has 2 levers and a single cylinder deadbolt. The Georgetown Lever Entryset is as beautiful as it is functional. It has a traditional look that makes it an especially great choice for historic homes. The Georgetown Rosette with Georgetown Lever and Deadbolt Combo Pack is available in a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOGEOCOM Georgetown Single Cylinder Entry Set Combo With Georgetown Lever:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgetown Lever Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Lever Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Georgetown Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 0.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOGEOCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOGEOCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
